e:["$","div",null,{"className":"story-copy","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"What sets DATIA apart is lead intelligence through a new breed of Account-Based Marketing campaigns that capture numerous intent insights, to detect sales-qualified leads at the right time. Our unique platform provides you with a more comprehensive view of which prospect to nurture and how. And just as critical, we keep your brand in front of the 95% of target prospects who aren’t ready to buy today, but will be tomorrow, next month, or next year."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Buyers across industries now do most of their research independently — often narrowing their shortlist long before they ever speak with a salesperson."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Solutions begin with an in-depth consultation to identify key target audiences and deliver on marketing objectives."}]]}]
